{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52108","headline":"五言奉和行经破薛举战地应诏 · 长孙无忌","name":"五言奉和行经破薛举战地应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天步昔未平，陇上驻神兵。\n戈回曦御转，弓满桂轮明。\n屏尘安地轴，卷雾静乾扃。\n往振雷霆气，今垂雨露情。\n高垣起新邑，长杨布故营。\n山川澄素景，林薄动秋声。\n风野征翼駃，霜渚寒流清。\n朝烟澹云䍐，夕吹绕霓旌。\n鸣銮出雁塞，叠鼓入龙城。\n方陪东觐礼，奉璧侍云亭。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"长孙无忌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}